    comment on column "playon"."main_marts_product"."fct_session_engagement".session_id is $dbt_comment_literal_block$One row per session in `data/fct_session`, and every session classified. The relationship test is what holds that 1:1 — `fct_user_engagement` joins these two models on `session_id`, so a session appearing here without a match upstream would fan out or vanish depending on join direction.
