    comment on column "playon"."main_marts_product"."fct_session_engagement".is_engaged_view is $dbt_comment_literal_block$The published definition. completion_pct >= var('engaged_view_min_completion_pct').$dbt_comment_literal_block$;
  
    
    
    comment on column "playon"."main_marts_product"."fct_session_engagement".engagement_tier is $dbt_comment_literal_block$Secondary three-tier split — `abandoned` / `sampled` / `engaged`. **Not the published definition.** Retained because the middle tier (watched 17–20%, then stopped, 1,760 sessions) is a churn-reduction target worth handing to growth. See engaged-view.md §6.4 — and note §5.9: these tiers show no retention signal in this dataset, so the commercial case rests on the behaviour being interpretable, not on a measured effect.
$dbt_comment_literal_block$;
  

  
